/-- Physical 1301..1313 are the logical homes of ticks 257..269; since tick 257 they sit at
1812..1800.  They are neither sites of window 285 nor excluded by `Exterior 285`, and `OB5.sig 284`/`OB5.sig 299` move
them, so `placements` cannot cover them.  The window never touches them and the cut reads raw 1812..1800 there (stock
carries, zero); the reference reads the same carries after the span (zero).  Script: `Leave270ReleasedActual.mirror`. -/
theorem oldBand_origin (d:Bool) (x p:Nat) (good:Bounds x p) (raw s:State) (dom:Domain 285 x p raw) (m t:List Bool)
    (neg far long:Bool)
    (packed:PackedCut Enter285.lowerPairs Enter285.upperPairs 300 1693 1691 1692 neg far long
